Runway API 焊进应用里，这插件安装体验也太顺了。", "url": "https://x.com/jojogh_007/status/2117395429952286991"}, {"author_id": "2117090303731445760", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:41:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117371443751055793"], "id": "2117371443751055793", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml I'd set that Model Router spending cap first; \"build me a video app\" still needs a budget, and the MCP can check the balance and tell me why a render failed.", "url": "https://x.com/PedroDaDHF/status/2117371443751055793"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:29:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117368543591190558"], "id": "2117368543591190558", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@BTBREPRESENTA @runwayml Sending that to your Grok Bot now.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2117368543591190558"}, {"author_id": "88835508", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:29:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117368517787836426"], "id": "2117368517787836426", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml @bot add this for me", "url": "https://x.com/BTBREPRESENTA/status/2117368517787836426"}, {"author_id": "1271726528695541761", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:28:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117368330596299042"], "id": "2117368330596299042", "lang": "fr", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml Un plugin qui branche l’API directement dans Cursor, c’est pratique. Tu dois quand même créer ta clé Runway à part, ou le plugin gère tout ça ?", "url": "https://x.com/VanessaDuranta/status/2117368330596299042"}, {"author_id": "1587673526177144832", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:00:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117361252984893935"], "id": "2117361252984893935", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml 这个插件思路对我们每天批量做短视频的卖家很实在：先把生成接进开发流程，少导几次素材就能省不少时间。我会先拿一个爆款商品做多版本口播测试，重点看人物口型和商品细节会不会崩，跑稳了再全量接。", "url": "https://x.com/clyve2022/status/2117361252984893935"}, {"author_id": "1998136947701927936", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:58:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117360677392146453"], "id": "2117360677392146453", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml one plugin gives cursor the runway api. does the editor inject the full generation schema on every turn or only when the agent actually calls a tool?", "url": "https://x.com/VibeCoderOfek/status/2117360677392146453"}, {"author_id": "417508671", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:18:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117350710945706393"], "id": "2117350710945706393", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml Less API plumbing, more time to make that strange little SI app idea work 🩷", "url": "https://x.com/thesimaximalist/status/2117350710945706393"}, {"author_id": "1954757752909377536", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:16:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117350272909635890"], "id": "2117350272909635890", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml Bridging generative video APIs directly into Cursor lets developers scaffold multimodal render pipelines with automated polling and zero boilerplate overhead.", "url": "https://x.com/mikesaiforge/status/2117350272909635890"}, {"author_id": "1624955572624949251", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:12:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117349046692290779"], "id": "2117349046692290779", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml Real test is whether Cursor uses the SDK's waitForTaskOutput or writes a setInterval poll. Your own docs beg people not to do the second one 😂", "url": "https://x.com/xTheMarketMaker/status/2117349046692290779"}, {"author_id": "1067541129145606144", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:08:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117348136364450111"], "id": "2117348136364450111", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml Plugins make the integration free. Taste stays the bottleneck: knowing what's actually worth generating in the first place.", "url": "https://x.com/talesbytim/status/2117348136364450111"}, {"author_id": "1001114465692200960", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:02:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117346616654889426"], "id": "2117346616654889426", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 164, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@biscuitweb It does. the agent uses the SDK’s wait helper so it polls until the render’s done. loading and error states included.", "url": "https://x.com/runwayml/status/2117346616654889426"}, {"author_id": "2043662599103844352", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:00:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117346032958988344"], "id": "2117346032958988344", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml Describe the video, and Cursor builds the whole Runway integration 👀 What's the first app you'd build with this?", "url": "https://x.com/davit__yan/status/2117346032958988344"}, {"author_id": "1577726234066157570", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:53:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117344277386932258"], "id": "2117344277386932258", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml could this plug into an app's existing generation queue without replacing its retry logic?", "url": "https://x.com/jatingargiitk/status/2117344277386932258"}, {"author_id": "1468680975672557568", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:50:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117343532981874743"], "id": "2117343532981874743", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 110, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml does it handle polling for the long renders", "url": "https://x.com/biscuitweb/status/2117343532981874743"}, {"author_id": "2018991920173785088", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:49:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117343305746817223"], "id": "2117343305746817223", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml I’d want the generated request visible before trusting Cursor with the integration", "url": "https://x.com/violetainsights/status/2117343305746817223"}, {"author_id": "95673344", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:46:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117342483826753880"], "id": "2117342483826753880", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml This is where API competition is heading. When a coding agent writes the integration instead of a person reading docs, the API that's easiest for the agent to wire up gets picked.", "url": "https://x.com/nikoraus/status/2117342483826753880"}, {"author_id": "1867579432803930112", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:43:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117341903830347961"], "id": "2117341903830347961", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 73, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@runwayml awesome, will check it out", "url": "https://x.com/learnwithazhar/status/2117341903830347961"}, {"author_id": "1001114465692200960", "conversation_id": "2117341561759629709", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:42:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117341573570802151"], "id": "2117341573570802151", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1969, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Get started: https://t.co/11FVitHN4V", "url": "https://x.com/runwayml/status/2117341573570802151"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2953739684", "name": "0xAzr", "username": "AzrianoY1"}, {"id": "2002688165828829184", "name": "𝗢𝗿𝗶𝗼𝗻", "username": "big_orion01"}, {"id": "800675767", "name": "Alex", "username": "Amazyys"}, {"id": "111498339", "na